# THE RECOGNITION RUNTIME LIVES HERE AND IS NOT VERSIONED.
#
# whisper.dll, ggml.dll, ggml-base.dll and the ggml-cpu-*.dll files that do the
# arithmetic are an unmodified public release of whisper.cpp, pinned to the build
# the headers in ../vendor/whisper.cpp/ were taken from. They are somebody else
# bytes, they weigh megabytes, and a download reproduces them exactly - so the
# repository keeps the recipe and the modding root keeps the files, the same way
# the weights are handled next door in ../../weights/.
#
# The full install is a folder of its own beside the other external tools:
#
#     D:\Skyrim VR Modding\whisper.cpp b5130\
#
# and only the files the child actually loads are copied in here, because the
# lay-out copies everything in this folder next to the child and the archive also
# carries thirty command line tools the mod has no use for.
#
# ../../README.md says which archive, from where, and what to do with it.
*
!.gitignore
